{"release":{"id":303640611,"tag":"v3.0.16","author":"cmdr2","name":"v3.0.16","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-03-31T10:04:03Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-31T10:59:22Z","markdown":"🔥 Adds support for:\r\n- Flux 2 Klein, Z-Image, Qwen and lots more models (including quantized gguf)!\r\n- Improves support for AMD and Intel GPUs (including integrated)\r\n\r\nEnable the `v4` engine to get the new features:\r\n1. Open the `Settings` tab in Easy Diffusion's UI.\r\n2. Select `v4 engine` in the Backend option.\r\n3. Press `Save` and restart Easy Diffusion.","html":"<p>🔥 Adds support for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flux 2 Klein, Z-Image, Qwen and lots more models (including quantized gguf)!</li>\n<li>Improves support for AMD and Intel GPUs (including integrated)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Enable the <code>v4</code> engine to get the new features:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the <code>Settings</code> tab in Easy Diffusion's UI.</li>\n<li>Select <code>v4 engine</code> in the Backend option.</li>\n<li>Press <code>Save</code> and restart Easy Diffusion.</li>\n</ol>\n","assets":[{"contentType":"application/x-zip-compressed","size":13299,"createdAt":"2026-03-31T10:55:37Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-31T10:55:39Z","downloadCount":9966,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/easydiffusion/easydiffusion/releases/download/v3.0.16/Easy-Diffusion-Linux.zip"},{"contentType":"application/x-zip-compressed","size":13299,"createdAt":"2026-03-31T10:55:39Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-31T10:55:39Z","downloadCount":5864,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/easydiffusion/easydiffusion/releases/download/v3.0.16/Easy-Diffusion-Mac.zip"},{"contentType":"application/x-msdownload","size":771907639,"createdAt":"2026-03-31T10:56:24Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-31T10:57:24Z","downloadCount":74196,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/easydiffusion/easydiffusion/releases/download/v3.0.16/Easy-Diffusion-Windows.exe"}]}}